DECISIONS 263, EVALUATION.md §12.2: the fold that spends the last step reports E4401 in the owner's own bag, so its bound gets no E3015; a bound folded after it, in a record of the same package, fails without a finding and is E3015 budget.
-- budget --
5
-- a/a.canon --
/// A.
package a

/// The base price.
const BASE = 100

/// The highest price.
const LIMIT = BASE + 1 + 1 + 1

/// A thing sold.
record Item {
  /// Its price.
  price: Int(0..=LIMIT)
}

/// Another thing.
record Other {
  /// Its count.
  count: Int(0..=9)
}
